 an account, in your cloud space so they follow you. See the "},{"type":"element","tag":"a","attrs":{"href":"privacidad.html"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Privacy"}]},{"type":"text","value":" page for details (in Spanish)."}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"details","attrs":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"summary","attrs":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Can I install SymphorIA as an app?"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Yes, no stores needed. On your phone you will see «Download our SynthFlow app»; on Android it installs with one tap and on iPhone with Share › Add to Home Screen."}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"details","attrs":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"summary","attrs":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The AI gave me a wrong answer"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"AIs can be wrong. Use «Again» for another answer or «Compare with another AI» for a second opinion. If it is a bug in the page, tell us below."}]}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tag":"footer","attrs":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"SymphorIA y SynthFlow · Hecho en Colombia."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}
